# The cycle's turn whoosh (src/sound.c), after the loop-break hits (as hit_sounds.steps): records
# the game's sound (/out/sound.wav). The third hit breaks the loop and is a turn itself; then a
# left turn and a right, 2 s apart. Each whoosh should be heard on its own side: louder in that
# channel of the recording. The press times show in the log (shots)
record_sound
wait_boot
start_intro
press b
wait 3.5
wait 2
shot press1
press left
wait 3
shot press2
press up
wait 3
shot press3
press right
wait 4
shot turn_left
press left
wait 2
shot turn_right
press right
wait 2
shot end
